: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.02" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260930/202609300228254971.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260930/202609300228254971.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">北京时间昨日晚间英超官方宣布，经过裁决确认曼城所有违反英超财务规则的指控均成立。英国文化、媒体和体育大臣丽莎·南迪在接受BBC采访时谈及此事的潜在影响。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-30/6abc08383ff45native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">曼城所有指控成立，拉波尔塔：不关我的事 我认为他们会提起上诉</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.37" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260930/202609300253178239.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.37" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.37" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260930/202609300253178239.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260930/202609300253178239.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">据天空体育报道，欧洲足球俱乐部大会结束后，巴萨主席拉波尔塔在被问及曼城所有指控均被判成立的消息时作出了回应。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-30/6abc14184f595native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">曼城案吹哨人：官方证实了我们最初曝光的消息，曼城终将迎来代价</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.78" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260926/202609261838346397.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.78" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.78" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260926/202609261838346397.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260926/202609261838346397.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">英超官方正式确认曼城财务违规事实后，曼城案核心吹哨人、“Football Leaks”创始人鲁伊·平托在社媒发文表态，称当年曝光的全部内容均已得到证实，曼城长年的舞弊操作终将迎来应有的后果。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-30/6abc16d706b21native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">独家爆料曼城案！DO：参加论坛时收到消息；按下发布按钮需要勇气</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-30/6abc18f2bda8dnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">DO：曼城很强硬＆乐观地认为能取胜，未来仍可能证明自己没有违规</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-30/6abc1b14d12eanative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">DO：一些俱乐部之间在进行法律层面活动，曼城案发展只能静观其变</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-30/6abc1ca3a18d7native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">DO：曼城案对英超或者曼城可能都不是好事，唯一赢家可能只有律师</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-30/6abc1e1c78a2bnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">DO：不认为曼城球员的合同有降级条款，球员合同并非他们最大问题</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.77" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260930/202609300354197298.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.77" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-r