ative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">暂时封存！斯卡洛尼：梅西告别赛前不会把10号给别人，之后会再看</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.78" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260930/202609300216358208_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.78" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.78" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260930/202609300216358208_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260930/202609300216358208_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">北京时间10月1日早晨8点，阿根廷将在友谊赛中对阵玻利维亚。赛前阿根廷主帅斯卡洛尼出席新闻发布会。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-30/6abc043d6178cnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">罗马官方：迪巴拉和莫利纳不会参加10月6日进行的梅西告别赛</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.79" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260929/202609290550131143.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.79" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.79" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260929/202609290550131143.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260929/202609290550131143.jpg"> </div><p><span style="co